### 3. Create the Recommender Controller

You need to create a new controller for handling the product recommendations.

#### `app/controllers/recommender_controller.rb`
<FILEPATH>
app/controllers/recommender_controller.rb
</FILEPATH>
<CODE>
class RecommenderController < ApplicationController
  # Assuming we have a Product model to interact with the database
  def index
    tags = params[:tags].split(',')
    products = Product.where("tags @> ARRAY[?]::varchar[]", tags).distinct
    render plain: products.map { |p| "<a href='#{p.link}'>#{p.product_name}</a>" }.join("<br>")
  end

  def create
    product_params = params.require(:product).permit(:product_name, tags: [])
    product = Product.new(product_params)

    if product.save
      render json: { message: 'Product created successfully' }, status: :ok
    else
      render json: { error: 'Invalid input' }, status: :bad_request
    end
  end
end
</CODE>

